	(text "Sensor head (SMA, bias-T) -> 2nd-order HPF 113 kHz -> gain x4.9 -> 2nd-order LPF 512 kHz -> THS4531 -> 10R/400pF -> ADS7057 -> ZedBoard PMOD."
