	(text "Listener (observer, never gates the chain). SIG_IN -> C40 100 pF / R35 10k to REFL (150 kHz high-pass) -> R36 2.2k / C41 100 pF (low-pass) -> LST."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 275 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a710e271-0a67-4d83-83dc-7473a8a69adb")
	)
	(text "TLV7022 open-drain comparators. Thresholds from the 1M / 33k / 18k ladder (about +-30 mV and +-84 mV for the 47 pF head, plus 3.6 mV of internal hysteresis). For the 100 pF head use 15k and 6.8k. WAKE_N = small window, BIG_N = large window. Pull-ups R24, R42 to +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 281 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "85be3be3-c0bf-48a4-a965-479a12c05774")
	)
